   "video_end": 12337.497,
   "notes": [
    "<p>Mayor Guthrie provided opening remarks regarding the Ward 6 Councillor Vacancy Appointment.</p>\n<p>Stephen O'Brien, General Manager, City Clerk's Office/City Clerk, introduced the Ward 6 Councillor Vacancy Appointment and presented regarding procedural matters on the appointment process.</p>\n<p>The following Certified Council Candidates presented to Council:<br/>Adam, Rebecca<br/>Bowman, Michelle<br/>Cavan, Jeremy<br/>Cawsey, Gregory<br/>Cherry, Dakota<br/>Coole, Robert<br/>Coulis, Shane<br/>Dandie, Morgan<br/>Ferlaino, Jessica<br/>Freese, Randy<br/>Genidy, Hesham<br/>Gordon, James<br/>Hauser, Katherine<br/>Hay, Donald</p>\n<p>Council recessed (5:39 p.m.). Council reconvened (5:49 p.m.).</p>\n<p>The following Certified Council Candidates presented to Council:<br/>Hendrikx, Justin<br/>Kaufmann, Daniel<br/>Keegan, Michael<br/>Li, Vivian<br/>Maldonado, Annika<br/>Mann, Barbara<br/>Mares, Renata<br/>Masi, Gerry<br/>McQuillen, Laura<br/>Ramos Jr., Evaristo<br/>Sowden, James</p>\n<p>The following Certified Council Candidate did not present to Council:<br/>O'Connor, Ryan</p>\n<p>Council recessed (7:02 p.m.). Council reconvened (7:07 p.m.)</p>"
   ],
