   "text_html": "<p>Hauser, Katherine</p>",
   "post_html": "<p>Voting in favour:</p>\n<p>Councillor Allt, Councillor Busuttil, Councillor Caron, Councillor Caton, Councillor Downer (5)</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>The following candidates did not meet the vote threshold, and were not considered in the second round of voting:  </p>\n<p>Bowman, Michelle<br/>Cavan, Jeremy<br/>Cawsey, Gregory<br/>Cherry, Dakota<br/>Coole, Robert<br/>Coulis, Shane<br/>Dandie, Morgan<br/>Ferlaino, Jessica<br/>Freese, Randy<br/>Genidy, Hesham<br/>Gordon, James<br/>Hay, Donald<br/>Hendrikx, Justin<br/>Kaufmann, Daniel<br/>Keegan, Michael<br/>Li, Vivian<br/>Maldonado, Annika<br/>Mann, Barbara<br/>Mares, Renata<br/>Masi, Gerry<br/>McQuillen, Laura<br/>O'Connor, Ryan<br/>Ramos Jr., Evaristo<br/>Sowden, James</p>\n<p>Mayor Guthrie thanked all candidates for putting their names forward. Council began conducting Round 2 of the Ward 6 Councillor Vacancy Appointment.</p>",
