   "text": "Hauser, Katherine",
   "text_html": "<p>Hauser, Katherine</p>",
   "post_html": "<p>Voting in favour:</p>\n<p>Councillor Allt, Councillor Busuttil, Councillor Caron, Councillor Caton, Councillor Downer, Councillor Goller (6)</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>A tie vote was declared.</p>\n<p>Stephen O'Brien, General Manager, City Clerk's Office/City Clerk, explained the procedures for a tie vote, and indicated a draw would be conducted by the City Clerk to choose the Council appointee. </p>\n<p>Stephen O'Brien, General Manager, City Clerk's Office/City Clerk, conducted the draw, and Hauser, Katherine, was chosen by lot.</p>",
