   "moved_by": "Chew",
   "seconded_by": "Goller",
   "text": "That Council appoint Katherine Hauser to fill the vacant Ward 6 Councillor seat for the term ending November 15, 2026.",
   "text_html": "<ol>\n<li>That Council appoint Katherine Hauser to fill the vacant Ward 6 Councillor seat for the term ending November 15, 2026.</li>\n</ol>",
   "post_html": "<p>Mayor Guthrie officially welcomed Councillor Hauser as a member of City Council, and Councillor to Ward 6.</p>",
